    "pluto_trine_mc": "<b>Pluto Trine MC:</b> Your deepest power, transformation, and primal intensity flows effortlessly with your public reputation, career, and life direction. This creates a natural talent and ease between these two areas of your life, though it can sometimes lead to complacency.",
