    "lilith_sextile_neptune": "<b>Black Moon Lilith Sextile Neptune:</b> Your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires harmonizes with your dreams, illusions, and spiritual empathy. This creates a supportive flow that encourages these two areas of your life.",
    "lilith_square_neptune": "<b>Black Moon Lilith Square Neptune:</b> Your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires creates tension and friction with your dreams, illusions, and spiritual empathy. This creates a challenging but highly motivating dynamic that demands action and resolution between these two areas of your life.",
    "lilith_trine_neptune": "<b>Black Moon Lilith Trine Neptune:</b> Your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires flows effortlessly with your dreams, illusions, and spiritual empathy. This creates a natural talent and ease between these two areas of your life, though it can sometimes lead to complacency.",
    "lilith_opposition_neptune": "<b>Black Moon Lilith Opposition Neptune:</b> Your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires is polarized against your dreams, illusions, and spiritual empathy. This creates a tug-of-war dynamic where you must learn to balance and integrate these two competing areas of your life.",
    "lilith_quincunx_neptune": "<b>Black Moon Lilith Quincunx Neptune:</b> Your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires is awkwardly misaligned with your dreams, illusions, and spiritual empathy. This creates a need for constant adjustment and compromise between these two areas of your life.",
